{"version":1,"content":"<p>據最新曝光的設計資料，蘋果正在為iPhone 18e重新設計後置相機模組，新設計將使這款入門級機型的背部外觀與現款iPhone 17e產生明顯區別。該消息來自Engadget獲取的計算機輔助設計文件，顯示蘋果計劃將相機、閃光燈和麥克風整合到一個凸起的模塊化外殼中。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587856.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T15:43:57.807775+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":137,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T15:25:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T15:37:17.177898+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T15:37:17.177898+00:00","content_hash":"dddbe589655df82f411b2294c182eb9a9a4365e7a38f815d46092c1c6971183b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}